  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 合作伙伴横幅\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cBoSu8s.png\" alt=\"Logo\" />\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" />\n</p>\n\n<!-- Social Links -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <a href=\"https://nightbeam.gitbook.io/rpg-attribute-system/\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=文档&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=read-the-docs&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\">\n</p>\n\n![https://i.imgur.com/JnL1prm.png](https://i.imgur.com/JnL1prm.png)\n\n\n\n<!-- Ko-fi -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/nightbeamstudio\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<!-- Description -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:auto; font-size:16px;\">\n    一款轻量级的 RPG 风格进度模组，通过根据玩家等级提供可成长属性来增强 Minecraft 游戏体验。随着玩家不断升级，生命值、伤害和体力等关键属性会自动提升，打造更加动态且富有成就感的升级体验。\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>RPG 风格等级进度</strong> – 玩家升级时，属性会自动成长。</li>\n    <li><strong>动态属性升级</strong> – 生命值、伤害、防御、速度等属性随进度提升而增加。</li>\n    <li><strong>自定义属性系统</strong> – 完全重写的属性逻辑，独立于原版系统。</li>\n    <li><strong>可配置的成长曲线</strong> – 可通过配置文件调整成长公式、倍率和前置要求。</li>\n    <li><strong>清晰的 UI 指示器</strong> – 屏幕叠加层（HUD）和工具提示会显示属性变化与进度。</li>\n    <li><strong>重制物品与背景设定</strong> – 包含如 <em>重生卷轴</em> 等用于重置属性的物品。</li>\n    <li><strong>服务端与客户端兼容</strong> – 在单人游戏与多人服务器中无缝运行。</li>\n    <li><strong>轻量且优化良好</strong> – 专为性能设计，运行开销极小。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\">\n</p>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7VVKSsj10kA\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\">\n</p>\n\n<h3><strong>需求</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Minecraft：</strong> 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5</li>\n    <li><strong>加载器：</strong> NeoForge 或 Forge</li>\n    <li><strong>库：</strong> JAUML</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 合作伙伴横幅\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n[bisect-banner]: https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\n[bisect-link]: https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam",
